    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>A namespaced attribute (e.g. the &apos;xml:lang&apos; in &apos;xml:lang=&quot;en&quot;&apos;)
which remembers the namespace prefix (&apos;xml&apos;) and the name (&apos;lang&apos;)
that were used to create it.
</verbatim> </para>
